# folded.scenarios — production-artifact contracts for folded BÍN recovery.
# These forms are absent from is.lex but present in the 350k BÍN surface tier
# used to build bin-morph.folded.bin. Every scenario starts at neutral P(IS).

LIMIT 5

SCENARIO exact folded BÍN spelling restores missing diacritics
T "afmælisoskir"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT afmælisóskir
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT afmælisóskir

SCENARIO folded BÍN plus j to k neighbor arms spacebar
T "afmælisosjir"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT afmælisóskir
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT afmælisóskir

SCENARIO folded BÍN plus g to h neighbor arms spacebar
T "andlitsgarum"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT andlitshárum
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT andlitshárum

SCENARIO folded BÍN plus t to r neighbor arms spacebar
T "annalatitarinn"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT annálaritarinn
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT annálaritarinn

SCENARIO folded BÍN plus n to m neighbor arms spacebar
T "alnugavæða"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT almúgavæða
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT almúgavæða

SCENARIO folded BÍN disambiguates afbrotamal from plain BÍN neighbors
T "afbrotanal"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT afbrotamál
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT afbrotamál

SCENARIO folded BÍN plus y to u neighbor arms spacebar
T "andofshopyrinn"
EXPECT_AUTOCORRECT andófshópurinn
T " "
EXPECT_LAST_COMMIT andófshópurinn
